{"title":"1977 USAMO Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_USAMO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> are two of the roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/4/0944eee52fa812c9196860e5b92a23b995cd8eae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^4+x^3-1=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"122\" height=\"16\" />, prove that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/8/ef870ce9fefe09b80a97b05a7b9198414c1b35f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" /> is a root of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/2/0a2a71c23084645cb1b264ddadbe22951ee3745d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^6+x^4+x^3-x^2-1=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"202\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_USAMO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Given the roots <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/6/bb60e0857a2c0a2c47acfbe81781032feb1f7150.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b,c,d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> of the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/3/973fd6662eae9b46351ad8e0eb1b9116a43825d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{4}+x^{3}-1=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"122\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>First, Vieta's relations give <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/0/0b006fba6db22894501fb420e67b169a28958a41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+c+d = -1 , ab+ac+ad+bc+bd+cd=0, abc+abd+acd+bcd=0, abcd = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"710\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/2/5122e8a7f3b669ffead178a2bebd1e9a27d709b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$cd=-\\frac{1}{ab}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"75\" height=\"37\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/3/2e319fc5d9b4ed3a3c9661710ea71218fecca897.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c+d=-1-(a+b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"161\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>The other coefficients give <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/2/f0241d61753da1d7cce7662f19a416e014a87681.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab+(a+b)(c+d)+cd = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"219\" height=\"18\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/1/47181f5b2ba7db474da3bf9c258ccfac8c6679a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab+(a+b)[-1-(a+b)]-\\frac{1}{ab}=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"279\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/6/0162211809d1f1d3e3fe5cf4408b4e138e0dcea1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b=s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"72\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/1/861f9a393c4d9383eb9de14217d3ea8bdd5add8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab=p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"50\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/f/4efec63f364270ac4d049a903732add68c9cd600.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0=ab+ac+ad+bc+bd+cd=p+s(-1-s)-\\frac{1}{p}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"418\" height=\"42\" />. &#160; (1)\n</p><p>Also, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/8/738c9db01e9f2144a1a3a63ad8755fffdd0f6370.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0=abc+abd+acd+bcd=p(-1-s)-s/p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"357\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Solving this equation for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/5/be54300738f17017b7aaa6ca197a5f95bebd6a34.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s= \\frac{-p^2}{p^2+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"86\" height=\"44\" />.\n</p><p>Substituting into (1): <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/d/43dbb4a3cb14b9fd5d4d5fc5f42e684ec01ccbdb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{p^{6}+p^{4}+p^{3}-p^{2}-1}{p(p^2+1)^2}=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"204\" height=\"45\" />.\n</p><p>Conclusion: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/5/bd50f740104be65482b986b5b8687584b39f9ba9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p =ab$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"52\" height=\"16\" /> is a root of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/f/b4f4e823cdc3d71fbea6695fbb81773ce5bdd0f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{6}+x^{4}+x^{3}-x^{2}-1=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"202\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_USAMO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:40%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_USAMO\" title=\"1977 USAMO\">1977 USAMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_USAMO_Problems\" title=\"1977 USAMO Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=27&amp;year=1977\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_USAMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1977 USAMO Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1977 USAMO Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_USAMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1977 USAMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_USAMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1977 USAMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1977 USAMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_USAMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1977 USAMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=USAMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"USAMO Problems and Solutions\"> All USAMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-al